    "zh": "在 14 回合内让芽芽安全到达东边的出口。光束遇到斜镜会转弯，踩到亮线就停机。踩下北边的开关，激光就会一直熄灭。走到南边的钥匙格，南廊的门就会打开。每走一格用一回合。",
    "en": "Reach the east exit safely within 14 turns. The mirror bends the beam. Sprout stops on a lit square. Stepping on the north switch keeps the laser off. Stepping on the south key unlocks the gate in the lower hall. Each move takes one turn."
